bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/1220217a152dcdd35267db31e86b6426.webp?t=1729003775\" /></div> - In the next 8 seconds, your enemy's attack is blocked.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/5c15eea9672336e91be1bf53595d93f1.webp?t=1729003775\" /></div> - Remove any booster or mockery that the opponent has accumulated. (exclusive on Versus mode)<br><br><br><strong> Have fun with 05 unmissable game modes: </strong><br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/a18d4476cf127b827123e50fccb241f1.webp?t=1729003775\" /></div> -  Save the Cerebine Kingdom from collapse by facing ever more challenging enemy reigns.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/4fae23766ddcf9c6cc192d4320efec8c.webp?t=1729003775\" /></div> - Destroy the enemy's tower before time runs out or weep in your tower\u2019s wreckage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/ad8d01d2a2b4285f511237afd91d544a.webp?t=1729003775\" /></div> - Great place to train, here you will face random battles with random difficulties.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/8d179741a45b7f850d983d77d0d8c51d.webp?t=1729003775\" /></div> - This game mode is for the strong! All your skill and agility will be put to the test.  Will you stand it up?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/01946c94286271e12aa4e969fec6b8fd.webp?t=1729003775\" 